","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4833234/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やぁやあー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4833234/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今一番食べたいものと聞かれたら間違いなくざるそばと答えるでしょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみです(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ乃木坂メンツと遊ぼうと試みてるんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか誘えまてん。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さーてあみと一番最初に遊ぶ事になる記念すべきメンバーは誰になるでしょうか(｀_´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで予想してみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4833234/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく質問返しいこうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*女の子のファンは気持ち悪くないでっか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えー気持ち悪い訳がなかろう！！\n女子最高"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4833234/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*・誕生日が一緒だけど、祝ってくれる⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.一緒に素敵な誕生日にしようね！？\nあみも祝うからあみの事も祝って？？o(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.愛知県といえば、何⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.名古屋？きしめん？味噌カツ？\nんーおいしい物いっぱい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4833234/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみは、文系？理系？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.どっちかというと文系かなーー\n古典だーいきらいだけど。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*Ｑ*３月２１日のブログの写真の服は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あれはね、ママのパジャマ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみは、どのメンバーと仲良いのかな!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.よく聞かれるけど、あみ本当にみんな仲良しなの。\nしいていえば、最近せっちゃんとの意気投合具合がやばい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4833234/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみはいつもコメント見てくれたりなんでそんなに優しいんですか？\nそんなあみあみが大好きなんですがどうしたらいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.みんなのコメントを見るのは当たり前！歯磨きみたいな感じ。\n大好きな皆様からの優しい楽しいコメント、ありがたいです。\nじゃあその気持ちを握手会で伝えて下さい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.握手会でいつもコメントしてる〇〇ですって言ってもわかる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.もちろん！わかるよ！！\nコメントくれてる方に会えた瞬間って\n本当神がかり的に嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4833234/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃぴ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"withひめたん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4833234/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんかわいすぎるー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会うといじります。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー今むしょうに乃木メンに会いたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま、明日会えるけどねーー(＾ｰ^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんじゃ明日は朝早いので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみみんな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/02/4833234/0008.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-31778":{